# Page shells, dev, tests and build work without any environment variables.
# Only for future Prisma CLI commands. Use Supabase PostgreSQL, never a second database.
# Copy the real direct/session connection URL from your Supabase project into .env.
# Never prefix database credentials with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@HOST:5432/postgres?sslmode=require"

# No Telegram, Auth or Storage keys are needed at stage 1.
# Add them server-side only when the corresponding integration is implemented.
